  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Raiffeisen Leasing - SME loan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A senior unsecured loan of up to EUR 15 million to be provided in two tranches  (Tranche 1: EUR 7 million; Tranche 2: EUR 8 million) under the Financial  Intermediaries Framework (&quot;FIF&quot;). The first tranche will be committed upon  signing, while the second tranche will be uncommitted and its commitment will  be at the EBRD&apos;s sole discretion.  The transaction is envisaged to provide financing for on-lending to local SMEs  for capital expenditure, primarily equipment and vehicles in line with the FIF  Policy Statement.</narrative>
  </description>
